[36m(TaskRunner pid=2357500)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2357500)[0m Let's represent \(z\) in its polar form. Since \(|z| = 4\), we can write \(z = 4e^{i\theta} = 4(\cos\theta + i\sin\theta)\). Then \(\frac{1}{z} = \frac{1}{4}e^{-i\theta} = \frac{1}{4}(\cos\theta - i\sin\theta)\).
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2357500)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2357500)[0m Substituting \(z\) and \(\frac{1}{z}\) into the expression, we get:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2357500)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2357500)[0m (75 + 117i)z + \frac{96 + 144i}{z} = (75 + 117i)4(\cos\theta + i\sin\theta) + \frac{96 + 144i}{4}(\cos\theta - i\sin\theta).
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2357500)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2357500)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2357500)[0m Simplifying the expression, we get:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2357500)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2357500)[0m (300 + 468i)(\cos\theta + i\sin\theta) + (24 + 36i)(\cos\theta - i\sin\theta).
