[36m(TaskRunner pid=2357500)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2357500)[0m Let's represent \(z\) in its polar form. Since \(|z| = 4\), we can write \(z = 4e^{i\theta} = 4(\cos \theta + i \sin \theta)\).
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2357500)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2357500)[0m Substituting \(z = 4(\cos \theta + i \sin \theta)\) into the expression, we get:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2357500)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2357500)[0m (75 + 117i)z = (75 + 117i) \cdot 4(\cos \theta + i \sin \theta) = 4(75 \cos \theta + 75i \sin \theta + 117i \cos \theta - 117 \sin \theta) = 4(75 \cos \theta - 117 \sin \theta + i (75 \sin \theta + 117 \cos \theta)).
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2357500)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2357500)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2357500)[0m \frac{96 + 144i}{z} = \frac{96 + 144i}{4(\cos \theta + i \sin \theta)} = \frac{96 + 144i}{4} \cdot \frac{\cos \theta - i \sin \theta}{\cos^2 \theta + \sin^2 \theta} = (24 - 36i)(\cos \theta - i \sin \theta) = 24 \cos \theta - 24i \sin \theta - 36i \cos \theta + 36 \sin \theta = 24 \cos \theta + 36 \sin \theta - i (24 \sin \theta + 36 \cos \theta).
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2357500)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2357500)[0m Adding these two expressions together, we get:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2357500)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2357500)[0m 4(75 \cos \theta - 117 \sin \theta) + 4(24 \cos \theta + 36 \sin \theta) + i (4(75 \sin \theta + 117 \cos \theta) - (24 \sin \theta + 36 \cos \theta)) = 4(99 \cos \theta - 81 \sin \theta) + i (4(71 \sin \theta + 81 \cos \theta)).
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2357500)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2357500)[0m The real part of this expression is \(4(99 \cos \theta - 81 \sin \theta)\). To maximize this, we need to maximize \(99 \cos \theta - 81 \sin \theta\). The maximum value of \(a \cos \theta + b \sin \theta\) is \(\sqrt{a^2 + b^2}\), so the maximum value of \(99 \cos \theta - 81 \sin \theta\) is \(\sqrt{99^2 + 81^2} = \sqrt{9801 + 6561} = \sqrt{16362} = 91.49\). Therefore, the maximum value of \(4(99 \cos \theta - 81 \sin \theta)\) is \(4 \cdot 91.49 = 365.96\).
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2357500)[0m 
