[36m(TaskRunner pid=2357500)[0m [response] To solve the problem, we need to maximize the real part of the expression \((75 + 117i)z + \frac{96 + 144i}{z}\) where \(|z| = 4\). Let's represent \(z\) in its polar form as \(z = 4e^{i\theta} = 4(\cos\theta + i\sin\theta)\). Then, we can substitute \(z\) into the expression and find the real part.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2357500)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2357500)[0m First, let's express \(z\) and \(\frac{1}{z}\) in terms of \(\theta\):
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2357500)[0m \[z = 4(\cos\theta + i\sin\theta)\]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2357500)[0m \[\frac{1}{z} = \frac{1}{4}(\cos\theta - i\sin\theta)\]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2357500)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2357500)[0m Now, substitute \(z\) and \(\frac{1}{z}\) into the expression:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2357500)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2357500)[0m (75 + 117i)z + \frac{96 + 144i}{z} = (75 + 117i)4(\cos\theta + i\sin\theta) + \frac{96 + 144i}{4(\cos\theta - i\sin\theta)}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2357500)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2357500)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2357500)[0m = 4(75\cos\theta + 75i\sin\theta + 117i\cos\theta - 117\sin\theta) + \frac{96 + 144i}{4(\cos\theta - i\sin\theta)}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2357500)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2357500)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2357500)[0m = 4(75\cos\theta - 117\sin\theta + i(75\sin\theta + 117\cos\theta)) + \frac{96 + 144i}{4(\cos\theta - i\sin\theta)}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2357500)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2357500)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2357500)[0m = 4(75\cos\theta - 117\sin\theta + i(75\sin\theta + 117\cos\theta)) + \frac{(96 + 144i)(\cos\theta + i\sin\theta)}{4}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2357500)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2357500)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2357500)[0m = 4(75\cos\theta - 117\sin\theta + i(75\sin\theta + 117\cos\theta)) + \frac{96\cos\theta - 96i\sin\theta + 144i\cos\theta - 144\sin\theta}{4}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2357500)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2357500)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2357500)[0m = 4(75\cos\theta - 117\sin\theta + i(75\sin\theta + 117\cos\theta)) + \frac{96\cos\theta - 144\sin\theta + i(144\cos\theta - 96\sin\theta)}{4}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2357500)[0m \]
